{'symbol': 'WAB', 'date': '2022-10-13 07:00:00', 'title': 'WABTEC PARTNERS WITH AKIEM ON SERVICE CONTRACT TO MAXIMIZE LOCOMOTIVE AVAILABILITY IN FRANCE AND GERMANY', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WABTEC CORPORATION (NYSE: WAB) SIGNED A SERVICES CONTRACT WITH AKIEM, A LEADING EUROPEAN ROLLING STOCK LEASING COMPANY, TO PROVIDE MAINTENANCE OF CRITICAL EQUIPMENT FOR LOCOMOTIVE FLEETS IN EUROPE.'}